{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S09把“难受时有人陪”的动机改写成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，判断更重、更窄，失去了Y原本较开放、准确的心理辨析。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词加亮、话与感受交替，使普通观众更容易迅速抓住每段发生了什么，以及人物心理如何转折；感受按音乐时点出现，也减少了同时面对大量短词的负担。尤其从怀念、矛盾、孤独，到决定带着想念继续生活，X的情绪变化与音乐细节结合得更连续、更具体。Y的优势是完整叙述比较自然，部分心理动机表达得更准确，尤其S09，但整体上观众更容易在X中同时获得故事脉络和细腻的听觉感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f28fa384-4dfa-4325-86a2-f2b10525b810", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T214435829045Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:45:33.570033+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2ac84fcc17f239f1fd681d4dcb725daea6d36a121686afb2e0c9a0eefc197ab5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha